<section class="reic-module" data-reic-module="138"><header><span class="reic-kicker">LOKALISASI</span><h2>Pusat Bahasa</h2></header><p>Pilih preferensi bahasa antarmuka.</p><form data-reic-form><label for="language-choice">Bahasa</label><select id="language-choice" name="language"><option value="id">Bahasa Indonesia</option><option value="en">English</option></select><button type="submit">SIMPAN BAHASA</button></form><output class="reic-status" aria-live="polite">Bahasa: Indonesia.</output></section>
